how I can use social
media to get sponsorships.

00:09:20.317 --> 00:09:21.616
Thank you.

00:09:21.616 --> 00:09:23.549
- Darius, you're using social media

00:09:23.549 --> 00:09:25.652
to get sponsorship right now, right?

00:09:25.652 --> 00:09:27.744
Your actions are leading
you to what you want.

00:09:27.744 --> 00:09:30.539
