00:09:30.539 --> 00:09:31.593
and now you're on the show,

00:09:31.593 --> 00:09:32.975
and now you've got a bunch of exposure,

00:09:32.975 --> 00:09:34.595
all the people watching and listening.

00:09:34.595 --> 00:09:36.083
I thought that was really clever.

