also agree that it's clever.

00:09:39.141 --> 00:09:43.144
One of those five to seven may
have a business proposition.

00:09:43.144 --> 00:09:45.198
But I think the number-one
way for you to sponsorship

00:09:45.198 --> 00:09:49.112
